contest2026_295_suanliheidong/logs/foamzzz/2026-09-05/codex__6a900370-d978-83ea-b272-5b72b62e2498.jsonl:149:{"schema_version":"1.0","session_id":"6a900370-d978-83ea-b272-5b72b62e2498","team_id":"contest2026_295_suanliheidong","github_login":"foamzzz","tool":"codex","seq":149,"ts":"2026-08-28T08:09:15.122Z","role":"assistant","text":"现在问题已经很明确了，而且这次不是网络、ASR、TLS 或 MiMo TTS 服务本身的问题。\n\n**真正的流式 TTS 代码没有进入你当前烧录的固件。**\n\n你这次日志中的 TTS 路径是：\n\n```text\n[vela_tls] Reusing pooled connection ...\n...\n[mimo_voice] TTS response bytes=236067 cap=1048576\n[mimo_voice] TTS audio base64 bytes=235580\n[mimo_voice] TTS WAV bytes=176684 pcm_cap=131072\n[mimo_voice] TTS PCM output too small wav=176684 pcm_cap=131072\n...\n[voice] TTS stream failed: -28\n```\n\n这完全对应你之前上传的旧版 `mimo_voice.c`：它仍然是“完整接收 JSON → 完整 Base64 解码 → 完整 WAV 解码 → 再塞进固定 PCM buffer”的流程。fileciteturn55file0L606-L732\n\n而我给你的流式版本中应该出现：\n\n```text\nTTS streaming request\ntransport stream enter\nTTS audio base64 stream begin\nTTS WAV data begin\nTTS stream done\n```\n\n你这次日志里这些标志一个都没有。\n\n### 当前为什么完全没声音\n\n这次实际上 TTS 服务已经成功工作了：\n\n```text\nTTS response bytes=236067\nTTS audio base64 bytes=235580\nTTS WAV bytes=176684\n```\n\n也就是说：\n\n**文字 → MiMo TTS → WAV 音频，已经全部成功。**\n\n真正失败的是下一步：\n\n```text\npcm_cap=131072\nWAV bytes=176684\n```\n\n你的 PCM 输出 buffer 只有：\n\n```text\n131072 bytes = 128 KiB\n```\n\n但这段语音对应的 PCM 大约是：\n\n```text\n176684 - WAV header\n≈ 176640 bytes\n```\n\n显然：\n\n```text\n176640 > 131072\n```\n\n于是 `extract_wav_pcm()` 返回：\n\n```text\n-ENOSPC = -28\n```\n\n最终：\n\n```text\n[audio_pb] closing (0 bytes written)\n```\n\n所以扬声器从头到尾一个 PCM 字节都没收到，自然完全没有声音。\n\n这也说明一个非常重要的进展：**现在 Wi-Fi、TLS、ASR、LLM、TTS 服务调用实际上都已经跑通了。最后的问题已经缩小到 TTS 播放数据路径。**\n\n而且你现有 `voice_channel.c` 已经具备真正的流式播放回调：收到一个 PCM chunk 就会直接调用 `audio_playback_write()`。fileciteturn58file0L17-L37 所以我们的方向没有问题。\n\n---\n\n现在先不要再调整 `pcm_cap`，也不要把 128 KiB 改成 256 KiB。那只是继续延长旧架构的寿命；以后模型回答稍微长一点仍然会爆。\n\n先在你电脑上执行下面这一组命令：\n\n```bash\ncd /home/foam/vela/openvela\n\necho \"===== SOURCE =====\"\n\ngrep -n -E \\\n\"TTS streaming request|mimo_tts_stream_synthesize|stream_synthesize =\" \\\npackages/ai_agent/src/voice/mimo_voice.c\n\necho \"===== TLS SOURCE =====\"\n\ngrep -n -E \\\n\"vela_https_post_json_stream|transport stream enter\" \\\npackages/ai_agent/src/infra/vela_tls.c\n\necho \"===== FINAL ELF =====\"\n\nstrings nuttx/nuttx | grep -E \\\n\"TTS streaming request|TTS audio base64 stream begin|TTS WAV data begin|TTS stream done|transport stream enter\"\n\necho \"===== OLD CODE IN ELF =====\"\n\nstrings nuttx/nuttx | grep -E \\\n\"TTS response bytes|TTS audio base64 bytes|TTS WAV bytes\"\n```\n\n正确结果应该满足：\n\n```text\nSOURCE:\n有 TTS streaming request\n有 mimo_tts_stream_synthesize\n有 stream_synthesize\n\nTLS SOURCE:\n有 vela_https_post_json_stream\n有 transport stream enter\n\nFINAL ELF:\n有全部 streaming 字符串\n\nOLD CODE IN ELF:\n不应该再有 TTS response bytes\n不应该再有 TTS audio base64 bytes\n不应该再有旧版 TTS WAV bytes\n```\n\n### 我尤其怀疑你的构建缓存\n\n你之前已经查到过存在：\n\n```text\npackages/ai_agent/src/voice/mimo_voice.c....o\npackages/ai_agent/src/voice/mimo_voice.c...._1.o\n```\n\n以及：\n\n```text\napps/libapps.a\nnuttx/staging/libapps.a\n```\n\n因此很可能是：\n\n```text\n你替换了源码\n       ↓\n…4028 tokens truncated…eidong","github_login":"foamzzz","tool":"codex","seq":3450,"ts":"2026-09-14T08:48:17.069Z","role":"tool","tool_name":"<result>","tool_call_id":"call_GxQlBQDfpao7WwvflKkGymmY","input":null,"output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n#\n# Build the contest ESP32-S3 board with a temporary, reversible\n# esp-hal-3rdparty lock-initializer backport.\n#\n# Fresh workspaces may not contain esp-hal-3rdparty yet. NuttX prepares it\n# during the normal build context phase, so this wrapper bootstraps that\n# phase first when needed, then applies the local backport and performs the\n# real build.\n\nset -euo pipefail\n\nreadonly SCRIPT_DIR